# {{name}}

A full-stack app made by `hyve init`: a serge UI (browser and desktop) and
the orbic backend it calls through `#[server]` functions.

```sh
hyve preview --web              # page at http://127.0.0.1:8080/ and the backend, reloaded on save
hyve preview                    # the same, plus the desktop window
cargo test --features server    # the backend on an in-memory database
```

Tables are created by the `.sql` files in `migrations/`, applied in name order.

`hyve preview` runs the frameworks' tools: `cargo install serge-cli --version ={{serge}}`
and `cargo install orbic-cli --version ={{orbic}}`. The browser build also needs
`rustup target add wasm32-unknown-unknown` and
`cargo install wasm-bindgen-cli --version ={{wasm_bindgen}}`.
